OL,3,GNEWSAAndrew takes legal action over
OL,4,Asearch warrants before his arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor is taking
OL,7,Flegal action against Thames Valley
OL,8,FPolice over his arrest in February.
OL,10,FThe former Prince Andrew was arrested
OL,11,Fon suspicion of misconduct in public
OL,12,Foffice, in the wake of information that
OL,13,Femerged from the Epstein files in the
OL,14,FUnited States.
OL,16,FMountbatten-Windsor's lawyers are
OL,17,Fchallenging the search warrants used in
OL,18,FSandringham and at Royal Lodge in
OL,19,FWindsor relating to his arrest, as
OL,20,Ffirst reported by the Telegraph.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
